    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ViCrew you build a crew of four Vikings which will go on raid missions for glory and fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generated ocean maps with many islands to explore await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through tough enemies, level up your vikings and plunder everything you can see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best strategy to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Generated</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission, map and enemy is random generated for replayability and variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-Based Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five playable classes: Warrior, Archer, Druid, Seer, Bard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel by Ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail and explore new islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Stronger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level your Vikings and get stronger to be ready for the hard missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your loot to buy food and camping supplies for your crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Character dies, he will be gone forever.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ViCrew you build a crew of four Vikings which will go on raid missions for glory and fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generated ocean maps with many islands to explore await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through tough enemies, level up your vikings and plunder everything you can see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best strategy to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Generated</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission, map and enemy is random generated for replayability and variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class-Based Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five playable classes: Warrior, Archer, Druid, Seer, Bard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel by Ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail and explore new islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Stronger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level your Vikings and get stronger to be ready for the hard missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your loot to buy food and camping supplies for your crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Character dies, he will be gone forever.</p>",
